cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use plant-genomics-mcp in your work, please cite it as below."
title: plant-genomics-mcp
abstract: >-
  A plant-genomics server for the Model Context Protocol (MCP) providing 50
  tools for locus lookup across 23 free, public backends — including Ensembl
  Plants, Phytozome BioMart, UniProtKB, Europe PMC, QuickGO, Planteome,
  PlantCyc/PMN, g:Profiler, NCBI BLAST, Gramene, JASPAR, KEGG, STRING-DB,
  ATTED-II, ThaleMine, and the Bio-Analytic Resource for Plant Biology (BAR).
  Covers single-locus lookup, motif and region queries, variant annotation,
  gene-set enrichment, BLAST search, parallel batch retrieval, and
  cross-source synthesis, over stdio and Streamable-HTTP transports.
